---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL } from "../lib/site";
---
<Layout title="Build Pied Piper" description="Build and run Pied Piper on your own machine.">
<section class="container" style="padding-block: 80px; max-width: 900px">
<p class="eyebrow">GET STARTED</p><h1 class="display">Build Pied Piper locally.</h1>
<p>This fork is distributed as source. Install Node.js 24 and Vite+, then clone the repository:</p>
<pre style="padding: 24px; overflow: auto"><code>git clone https://github.com/ashxco/piedpiperapp.git
cd piedpiperapp
vp install
vp run dev</code></pre>
<p>Connect an installed coding provider to start working. Cloud relay and app-store distributions require separately configured infrastructure.</p>
<a class="btn btn-primary" href={GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL}>Repository and setup instructions</a>
</section>
</Layout>
